<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Definance H1 1996 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Belgian Definance H1 1996 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Belgian francs unless stated):</p>
<p>    Group loss		   113	  vs    39 loss</p>
<p>    Minorities		    36 profit vs     3 loss</p>
<p>    Cons current profit	 38	  vs    n/a</p>
<p>    Cons income		  169	  vs    83</p>
<p>    Cons charges		 246	  vs   125</p>
<p>NOTE - Belgian holding company Definance said in a statement its wider loss was principally due to a large write-down on its stake in loss-making Belgian mortgage and savings bank Anhyp.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
